      "passes": true,
      "notes": "Used virtual files pattern with // @filename: directives. Had to inline @xschemadev/client types since it's not published to npm. The ^? annotation shows ZodObject<{ id: ZodString; name: ZodOptional<ZodString>; email: ZodString }, $loose>"
    },
    {
      "title": "Add Twoslash to typescript.mdx schema lookup section",
      "description": "As a user, I want to see return types for schema lookups including multi-namespace and defaultNamespace.",
