      "passes": true,
      "notes": "Added twoslash to both Schema lookup code blocks. First block shows full key format with types for both user:Profile (ZodObject with id, name?, email) and app:Config (ZodObject with theme enum, language, debug?). Second block shows defaultNamespace example with shorthand Profile lookup resolving correctly."
    },
    {
      "title": "Add Twoslash to typescript.mdx XSchemaType section",
      "description": "As a user, I want to see what types XSchemaType extracts.",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
