      "passes": true,
      "notes": "Added twoslash to both XSchemaType code blocks. First block shows Profile ({ id, email, name? }) and Config ({ theme enum, language, debug? }) extracted types. Second block shows function signatures with typed property access (data.email: string) and schema.parse() return type."
    },
    {
      "title": "Add autocomplete and error examples to typescript.mdx",
      "description": "As a user, I want to see autocomplete for schema keys and errors for invalid keys so I understand the DX benefits.",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
