      "passes": true,
      "notes": "Added ^| autocomplete annotation showing user:Profile and app:Config suggestions when typing 'u'. Error example uses // @errors: 2345 with typo 'user:Proflie'. Both render correctly in browser - autocomplete shows inline suggestions, error shows red text with full type error message."
    },
    {
